{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那日，七个女人将拉着一个男人，说：“我们吃自己的，穿自己的，只求你娶我们，让我们归在你名下，除掉我们的羞辱。”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的复兴"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那日，耶和华的苗必长得茂盛华美，这地方的出产必成为以色列幸存者的骄傲和光荣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["主必以审判的灵和焚烧的灵洗净锡安女子的污秽，清除耶路撒冷的血迹。所有锡安剩余的人，即留在耶路撒冷、名字记录在生命册上的人都将被称为圣洁的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华必在日间造烟云遮蔽整个锡安山和那里的会众，在夜间造火光照亮他们。祂的荣耀必遮盖一切。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["必有白日避暑的亭子，躲避狂风暴雨的避难所和藏身处。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}